 "s0208": "Neobutin, TVR",
 "s0209": "Neobutin and Trimedat put **100% of ad investment into National TV**, reaching the target audience at scale through regular seasonal flights",
 "s0210": "**Competitors use TV as a constant driver of brand visibility, not as one-off support.**",
 "s0211": "In 2026, **Neobutin ran 3 flights totaling 5,326 TVR, Trimedat 4 flights with 5,781 TVR**, keeping audience contact high",
