 "s0337": "Trimedat **keeps the lead** in sales share, but **its share fell from 70.2% in January to 65.7% in June**. Neobutin’s share moved within 29–33%, while **Dinobutin steadily strengthened its position**. This leaves room for the new brand to grow, but does not show sales shifting directly from any one competitor",
